Data services
-------------
The wires fetch from outside services on the reader's own machine; each is
credited in the paper's "Sources & licences" list, as its terms ask. Some
are for personal or non-commercial use only (Open-Meteo, xkcd, TheMealDB's
test key). The Tape (share closes from Yahoo Finance) is off unless the
reader turns it on: Yahoo's terms do not permit automated collection, so it
is for personal use at the reader's own risk, until a licensed feed
replaces it.
